  "goodToKnow": "Die Repressalie is a reprisal or punitive measure, almost always plural: Repressalien gegen Oppositionelle, aus Angst vor Repressalien. It covers harassment, job loss or arrest by authorities or employers. Whistleblowers in Germany have been protected from Repressalien by law since 2023. Related: die Repression (oppression). Synonyms: die Vergeltung, die Schikane. Plural: die Repressalien."
